[Intro]

[Verse 1]
[00:29.15]Sharpen the spear, salt the blade
[00:31.99]Bind the bone-helm to thy brow
[00:35.09]Kiss the wolf upon her teeth
[00:37.81]We rideth, we rideth now

[00:40.87]Black the banner, red the dawn
[00:43.64]Loud the lur upon the hill
[00:46.61]What was sleeping in the stone
[00:49.31]Walketh with the warband still

[Pre-Chorus]
[00:52.46]Hammer, hoof, and hallowed horn!
[00:55.16]Steel, and stone, and stridings nine!

[Chorus]
[01:01.01]March! March! Antler-crowned!
[01:03.75]March beneath the raven sky!
[01:06.70]Drink the field, devour the road
[01:09.41]Carry fire where the cowards lie!
[01:12.51]March! March! Wolf and son!
[01:15.21]March until the kingdoms fall!
[01:18.13]Sing the name the gods forgot
[01:20.85]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir, call!

[Verse 2]
[01:35.48]Cleave the gate, break the wall
[01:38.02]Bury kings beneath their crowns
[01:40.90]Their gods are gilt, their gods are gold
[01:43.78]Ours are bark and bone and ground

[01:46.70]We are the hand the forest sendeth
[01:49.66]We are the wound the woods bestow
[01:52.82]What thou tookest from the wild
[01:55.39]Wild shall taketh, blow for blow

[Pre-Chorus]
[01:58.59]Hammer, hoof, and hallowed horn!
[02:01.38]Steel, and stone, and stridings nine!

[Chorus]
[02:07.39]March! March! Antler-crowned!
[02:10.07]March beneath the raven sky!
[02:13.05]Drink the field, devour the road
[02:15.69]Carry fire where the cowards lie!
[02:18.75]March! March! Wolf and son!
[02:21.65]March until the kingdoms fall!
[02:24.42]Sing the name the gods forgot
[02:27.03]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir, call!

[Bridge]
[02:31.29]Hoo! Hah! Hoo! Hah!
[02:36.43]Vér komum sem eldr!
[02:51.05]Hoo! Hah! Hoo! Hah!
[03:05.59]Vér komum sem eldr!

[Breakdown]
[03:20.05]Loose the hounds
[03:21.45]Loose the dead
[03:22.78]Loose the song the elder said

[Final Chorus]
[03:28.87]March! March! Antler-crowned!
[03:31.58]March beneath the raven sky!
[03:34.46]Drink the field, devour the road
[03:37.22]Carry fire where the cowards lie!
[03:40.29]March! March! Wolf and son!
[03:43.07]March until the kingdoms fall!
[03:45.91]Sing the name the gods forgot
[03:48.61]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir, call!

[Outro]
[03:54.57]Heyr oss
